  "job_B3.3.19_20251003_114707": {
    "text": "De purificatione sancta Maria.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, s\u00e6ge\u00f0 us & mynga\u00fe \u00feis halige godspel be \u00feysse arwyr\u00f0an tide \u00fee we nu tod\u00e6ge Gode\n\u00fe\u00e6t is se feowertiga d\u00e6g nu tod\u00e6g ures dryhtnes h\u00e6lendes Cristes acennesse, & \u00fey d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t his aldoras\n& \u00fea cwomon dryhtnes aldoras to \u00f0am Godes temple & hie \u00f0\u00e6r Gode \u00e6lmihtigum as\u00e6gdnesse brohton,\n\u00d0\u00e6r w\u00e6s \u00fea sum eald man in Hierusalem in \u00fe\u00e6re byrig in \u00fea ilcan tid se w\u00e6s haten Simeon.\nHe w\u00e6s so\u00f0f\u00e6st & rihtwis, & he bead \u00fe\u00e6re frefre \u00fe\u00e6re \u00fee he wiste \u00fe\u00e6t he his folce gehaten h\u00e6fde.\n& se halga gast w\u00e6s mid \u00feone Simeon.\n& he \u00fe\u00e6re andsware onfeng fram \u00feam halgan gaste, & he him cydde & s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t he ne moste dea\u00f0es\nHe \u00f0a cwom \u00feurh haliges gastes gife in \u00fe\u00e6t Godes templ on \u00fea ilcan tid \u00fee Cristes aldoras hine \u00feyder\n& \u00fea genam se halga Simeon \u00feone h\u00e6lend on his earmas, & he hine mid bam handum beclypte, & he\nUs is nu to witane, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t for \u00fean Cristes aldoras \u00fey feowertigan d\u00e6ge hine brohton to\n\u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s in \u00fe\u00e6re Godes \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwylc wif swa bearn cende, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne moste in \u00fe\u00e6t Godes templ\n& \u00feonne \u00fey feowertigan d\u00e6ge w\u00e6re, heo \u00feonne sceolde \u00fe\u00e6t bearn gebringan to \u00feam Godes temple.\nFor \u00fean \u00fee ealle wif \u00fee tymende syndon hie sendon on \u00feam bebodum, \u00fee sancta Maria, Cristes moder.\nFor \u00f0an seo eadigu cwen sancta Maria, heo cl\u00e6ne abad \u00fe\u00e6s feowertigan d\u00e6ges, nalles \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00fe\u00e6s\n& heo eac for \u00feam brohte Crist in \u00fea tid to \u00feam Godes temple \u00fe\u00e6t heo wolde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t word w\u00e6re\nMen \u00fea leofestan, us is nu eac to witanne \u00fe\u00e6re burge naman \u00fee is genemned Hierusalem, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne\nSwa \u00feonne bi\u00f0 symble \u00feam so\u00f0f\u00e6stum & \u00feam godfyrhtum mannum in sybbe, him bi\u00f0 gegearwad ece\n& hie sylfe \u00fe\u00e6r Gode \u00e6lmihtigum & his \u00f0am halgan him sylfum bebeoda\u00fe mid halgum gebedum, & hie\n& hie \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t geearnia\u00fe \u00e6t Gode \u00e6lmihtigum \u00fe\u00e6t hie moton becuman to \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0an sybbe gesyh\u00f0e,\nFor \u00fean, men \u00fea leofestan, us gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we symble in ealle tid rihte lufan & sybbe betweonan us\nBro\u00f0or mine, us is eac to witanne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00feearfendra manna as\u00e6gdnesse in \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t hie\nSwylce as\u00e6gdnesse Cristes aldoras hine mid brohton to \u00feam Godes temple.\nIn \u00fean w\u00e6s getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t ure h\u00e6lenda Crist for ure lufan w\u00e6s \u00feearfende in middangearde, \u00fe\u00e6t he us\n& he for ure lufan astah of heofonum to eor\u00f0an, & he manige ehtnesse & costunge & wi\u00f0erweardnesse\n& he us eac forgeaf ece lif & ece reste in \u00fe\u00e6re toweardan worulde, gif we hit mid godum d\u00e6dum & mid\n& \u00fea fugelas \u00fee we \u00f0\u00e6r \u00e6r gehyrdon nemnan, \u00fe\u00e6t syndon \u00feonne turturas & culfran, hie getacnia\u00fe lifes\nSwa we sculon eac beon in urum life cl\u00e6ne & unsce\u00f0\u00f0ende, \u00fe\u00e6t be us sie rihtlice \u00fe\u00e6t word gecweden\nEac we sculon habban mid us Godes so\u00f0f\u00e6stnesse & his rihtwisnesse & ea\u00f0modnesse, swa we \u00e6r\nSo\u00f0lice he h\u00e6fde lifes cl\u00e6nnesse gehealden, ge in wordum ge in d\u00e6dum ge in ge\u00f0ohtum & eac in\nMen \u00fea leofestan, we gehyrdon \u00e6r in \u00feyssum halgan godspelle secgan \u00fe\u00e6t se eadiga Simeon his anes\nOn \u00f0am he getacnode \u00fe\u00e6t we sceoldon beon swylces modes & swylces gewittes & on swylcre willan\nHealdan we eac \u00fe\u00e6t mid godum d\u00e6dum & mid \u00e6\u00f0elum mancystum \u00fe\u00e6t we beon godum mannum\nHe swa cw\u00e6\u00f0: L\u00e6t nu, dryhten, faran in sybbe \u00feine \u00feegnas \u00e6fter \u00feinum wordum swa \u00f0u him \u00e6r\nEfne swa he cw\u00e6de: L\u00e6t me faran of \u00fe\u00e6re tyddernesse \u00feysses meniscan lichaman \u00fee ic nu git on eom;\nFor \u00f0an \u00fee ic \u00fe\u00e6re andsware onfenc \u00fe\u00e6t ic ne moste dea\u00f0es byrian \u00e6r \u00fean ic \u00f0e, dryhten, mid minum\n& nu gesegon mine eagan \u00feine h\u00e6lo \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0u geearuwadest to leohte & to frofre manigum \u00feeodum &\nSo\u00f0lice ure h\u00e6lend is \u00f0\u00e6t so\u00f0e leoht & \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0e ece se \u00f0e inlihte\u00f0 \u00e6lcne mannan \u00f0e in middangeard\n& eall mancynn he gebyrhte\u00f0 & inlihte\u00f0 mid his \u00ferymmes mihte & mid his wuldre.\nFor \u00fean englas hine heredon & wuldredon & him lof s\u00e6gdon \u00e6t his acennesse & \u00f0us cw\u00e6don: Wuldor\n\u00dea cyrdon \u00fea englas to ure sybbe & to ure lufan, \u00fea hie gesegon & ongeaton \u00f0\u00e6t dryhten Crist w\u00e6s\n\u00deonne, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feeah is swi\u00f0e mycel nyd\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we us in \u00e6ghwylce tide beon wi\u00f0 synnum\nAc \u00e6ghwylc man hine sylfne healde & cl\u00e6nsie in rihtwisnesse & in cl\u00e6nnesse his lifes, \u00fea lytlan\nAc utan we nu for \u00fean, bro\u00f0or mine, herian we urne dryhten h\u00e6lende Crist & hine wuldrian &\nDon we him symle \u00feancas of urum spedum, for \u00fean \u00fee he us ontynde heofona rices duru \u00feurh his \u00fea\nBiddan we nu urne dryhten \u00e6lmihtigne & sancta Marian \u00fe\u00e6t he us forgife for his mildheortnesse & for\n& we \u00fe\u00e6r habba\u00f0 a so\u00f0e sybbe & so\u00f0e lufan in ecnesse & so\u00f0ne gefean & ecne eard & ece wuldor",
